# {{label|en|zoology}} Either the [[greater adjutant|greater]] or the [[lesser adjutant]], [[stork]] species of the [[genus]] {{taxfmt|Leptoptilos|genus}}, [[family]] {{taxfmt|Ciconiidae|family}}, [[native]] to [[India]] and [[Southeast Asia]]. {{defdate|from 1798|refn=OED}}
