Compare {{cog|da|Julius}}, {{cog|sv|Julius}}, {{cog|fo|Julius}}, {{cog|is|Júlíus}}, {{cog|de|Julius}}, {{cog|fr|Jules}}, {{cog|it|Giulio}} and {{cog|es|Julio|t=male given name}}.

