===Etymology===
{{etymon|en|:bor|pa:ਪੰਜਾਬ//پنجاب<ety:bor<fa-cls:پَنْجَاب>>|tree=1}}
From {{bor|en|pa|ਪੰਜਾਬ|tr=-}} / {{m|pa|پنجاب|sc=pa-Arab|tr=pañjāb}}, from {{der|en|fa-cls|پَنْجَاب|t=[Land of] the Five Rivers}}, from {{m|fa-cls|پَنْج|t=five}} and {{m|fa-cls|آب|t=water}}, referring to five rivers of the {{w|Punjab region}}:<ref>{{R:OED Online|code=154682}}</ref> the [[w:Jhelum River|Jhelum]], the [[w:Chenab River|Chenab]], the [[w:Ravi River|Ravi]], the {{w|Sutlej}} and the [[w:Beas River|Beas]]. The [[Persian]] term is a calque of {{der|en|sa|पञ्चनद|t=[Land of] the Five Rivers}}, from {{m|sa|पञ्च|t=five}} and {{m|sa|नद|t=river}}.<ref>{{cite-web |url=http://dsalsrv02.uchicago.edu/cgi-bin/philologic/getobject.pl?p.1:375.hobson |accessdate=12 May 2019 |archiveurl=https://web.archive.org/web/20181201141824/http://dsalsrv02.uchicago.edu/cgi-bin/philologic/getobject.pl?p.1:375.hobson |archivedate=1 December 2018 }}</ref><ref>{{cite-web |url=http://dsalsrv02.uchicago.edu/cgi-bin/app/macdonell_query.py?qs=%E0%A4%AA%E0%A4%9E%E0%A5%8D%E0%A4%9A%E0%A4%A8%E0%A4%96&searchhws=yes |accessdate=10 July 2018 |archiveurl=https://web.archive.org/web/20181201141645/http://dsalsrv02.uchicago.edu/cgi-bin/app/macdonell_query.py?qs=%E0%A4%AA%E0%A4%9E%E0%A5%8D%E0%A4%9A%E0%A4%A8%E0%A4%96&searchhws=yes |archivedate=1 December 2018 |title=Macdonell, Arthur Anthony. A practical Sanskrit dictionary with transliteration, accentuation, and etymological analysis throughout. London: Oxford University Press, 1929. }}</ref> Related to {{m|en|punch|id=beverage|t=beverage made of mixed fruit juice}}.

