#* {{quote-journal|en-US|author=Frank Bruni|title=Pam Bondi and the MAGA Brand of Insult Politics|work=The New York Times|date=2026-02-16|url=https://www.nytimes.com/2026/02/16/opinion/pam-bondi-trump.html|issn=0362-4331|passage={{quote-gloss|JD}} Vance has only a '''scintilla''' of the experience that many previous vice presidents had. But he can best them in contemptuousness.}}

