#* {{quote-journal|en|title=Franklin Simon & Co. [advertisement]|editor=w:Frank Crowninshield|magazine=[[w:Vanity Fair (magazine)|Vanity Fair]]|location=New York, N.Y.|publisher=Vanity Fair Publishing Company|month=February|year=1915|volume=3|issue=6|page=3|pageurl=https://books.google.com/books?id=AsY-AQAAMAAJ&pg=PA87|oclc=423870134|passage=''Suede Leather Hat'', in gray, '''champagne''', rose or blue, flower-trimmed.}}
