#* {{quote-journal|en|author=Alexandra Topping|title=Giant piranha found in Devon river|magazine=w:The Guardian|url=https://www.theguardian.com/environment/2009/aug/28/piranha-devon-river|date=2009-08-28|passage=At a length of 36cm (14in), the red-bellied '''piranha''' was a giant of its kind – more than eight inches longer than an average specimen.|archiveurl=https://web.archive.org/web/20250827211422/https://www.theguardian.com/environment/2009/aug/28/piranha-devon-river}}
